<title>USA: General Signal Q3 shr rises to $0.75.</title>
<headline>General Signal Q3 shr rises to $0.75.</headline>
<text>
<p>STAMFORD, Conn.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.75		    $0.26</p>
<p> Net			 37,400		   12,800</p>
<p> Sales		    521,600		  481,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,800		   49,300</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.90		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			 94,400		   15,800</p>
<p> Sales		  1,518,300		1,361,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  49,600		   49,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: First Call earnings estimate for the quarter is $0.69 per share.</p>
<p>The current quarter includes $3.6 million or $0.07 per share for one-time royalty and insurance items.</p>
<p>Year-ago quarter includes $14.4 million or $0.29 per share charge for discontinued operations. Year-ago nine-month period $64 million or $1.30 per share charge for discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Full company name is General Signal Corp.</p>
</text>
